  "contract": [
    "Taragaman the Hungerer (11520) starts Massive Fire Nova (2102516, 6 s cast, magic) 7 s after raising the",
    "Rumbling Earth pillars (663030), and cast slows on him lengthen it (#7764). The pillars despawned 15 s after",
